{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 131,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71eb0c9873edd1f120e32aaa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每当独自奔跑时，就会感受到有如针刺的疼痛，以及焦躁……\\n即使如此也不停下脚步，就算可能性低于零也是。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5a2309f80c77c02aadb326ca16509db873d70bd7eb1a508c18991113ed91464",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f185de7d34409956080a3622",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为了达成使命，去钻研磨练、去激昂、热血起来。\\n超越现在的自己吧──SUPER STRONG.",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f2d108aec9368d671105c0f0e1cdb1ae746a0aec1f4e64aef78222689329966",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9339df81c0bbe1fbbcbb1eea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一生仅有一次的光辉就在此处。无论摔倒多少次都不会放弃。\\n带着决心和勇气，与伙伴一起──用全力在梦想的舞台上奔驰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b06144b3435f2c646d3275990b41ddf06b1d901ff712e2ae00da291ba733b59",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04cfa093a908022cb27c85d3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只要两人有良好的契合度，不走运的日子也Don't Worry☆\\n幸运、快乐和胜利，全部都能抓进手中☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a49ac0bbb95863592bb7a0900f44b962517bb57933294f59bb0b13ea1caa50b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5ac21f3ae16cfe2a0ca24b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "倾注祝福！醉于狂乱！禁忌的果实就在不可能的彼端。\\n来吧，这是超越神话的破灭之始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33c0ede336992011f864b6c3b5101d6e2611c34fb316d5ef383a0627c0dc3d32",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18656ae8c8fdee0d07912f79",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "超越法则，领先光速──只要在我的脚加上名为「你」的要素，\\n就能解答一切，揭开未曾见得的A计划。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc38bf1bb20148bfef3032927fc02a53624dc96d930d336480d39f5488db1958",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:370dff613574b6dcb26f751f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "憧憬的她身边的位置，就算是我……！\\n不论因为自己的笨拙而灰心多少次，最后也绝对能……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa173d29ca3d878a9fe239066f368ca99b481532eb89f3ceb6b08e0bdb652619",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d353118874cd3812814f8077",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赞颂霸王吧！奏响欢喜吧！见证这震撼人心的一幕吧！\\n现在，前无古人的荣光，即将刻划在历史上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27818d2f50ed45d8d63c31df830fe15f70a0de04504877a68cbb580e4295fd15",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1112"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f588bbdce60c8f1b6e25f55b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在寂静之中，背负着起誓过的使命持续奔驰。\\n为了带着如同一等星般的闪耀，将胜利献给夜空──",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d7ec03da3605368e844dbf54ca61d8f863b679539eda7cde6153c00f50b36a7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2331af0a9d384f8e4a8875b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即使因面前的高墙而害怕，你的声援仍点燃了我的斗志。 \\n无论几次都会向梦想发起挑战。永不放弃──再一次！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cbe69fcbb5af12748a1d2182cc7ae869458b860d1ef52c360f5bec71bb35bb4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b779b71d6eaad5aaccec51f0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "轻快的摇滚节奏中高声歌唱，\\n黄金的浪漫！以一夜暴富为目标，Ships set sail!",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3a554eb47cf20fcc2fa516ae9e838c367dfc8375ef0c0b9a513f026710c5c49",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1115"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcd1331383c79a928263f391",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "每天坚持努力，总有顺风的时候……应该吧！\\n配合流行的节奏，加油，加油，嗯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f488b795cbd8a00e3b298ece9db629e25af1516712facbae738ae24448a0d139",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8a20bfc34708c643520f36f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "毫无疏漏，毫无阻碍，一切都缜密安排。彻底的管理就是完美，\\n以钢铁意志贯彻的是『跑完全程的觉悟』——",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7dfc449a389c02fa5fb9131a48ef55298bb5fc2765032bb85f1e9b6947df8ee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1117"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51b2d5edfe019398cabf49a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "涡轮全开！冲向极限的彼方！！\\n所谓不放弃，就是这样的啊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fe6690de38dad7c4044f4be6859d9b419fdbf8bea8685c6dfad9f9a5e67d528",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe8c38bbe59ae35d2da24dfe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为心灵的杯子增添色彩的是……\\n怀着淡淡的忧伤，歌唱新的旅程。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7009403d793bf42a8497e245702625a8f6c43d84f6fa25e1234de36d9fdd0c2c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1119"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f38c056deba6af3d2a76cfdd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "像在春日暖阳下散步一样，为心灵充满元气吧！\\n无论什么事都能顺其自然！嗯，没问题的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fd71a3fb4b0cfb5770cc07f25a07199ab1765694d3dd294923ae59956118859",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1120"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff27a7ac3762063397a2f11b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不管周围怎么说，我就是我。\\n虽然笨拙，但不是装出来的，我是真心在这里——",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c697fcf4ea08d38904c5a5673f813a108bd147eb93326913b46a032164c27fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb0f9be909faac76506fa971",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "让脑髓都震颤的狂野斗争本能。\\n真正的王者，征服一切，走向荣耀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9253b52c5a978ef6751b3ceaee5d12c8534cf582282adb7aaafff43a33757f16",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62773de6dc049cf4cecfa9e7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不赌上一切的胜负有什么价值？\\n让热血沸腾，洞察极限，赌徒现在就要出手……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf11823f6ff3b451f92d93c5c1d8fe748194e613d8f0939342929cec4f2e91a5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70734ca03fe3aba8bfb5f8ac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "奔跑过的道路，与你的足迹，将一直延续到远方。\\n不要忘记，这如奇迹般的日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c663adc7b5cc79c58e8447fe112297f319ee56226c78167c8e743d5ebfeb008",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1124"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9677e6447f1746cbbde0492e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "充满挑战的路上，永远有大家在身旁。\\n用跳跃的步伐抓住闪闪发光的碎片吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a70131b9cc1b241d7e5ebab4a62755e2533df2020d302497d88182997c7be7e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1125"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c56b5293eadd8319e441873",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "打破新时代之门的人……就是我！\\n追求最强灵魂的呐喊，我将撼动大地！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30532eb909841aad63a8ca7eb648edbc6b3d15d63c89c083cabacac81ca28d7b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1126"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e61f8eb022bf32b489c6c2ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "前进、行进、船进进！变成幼儿园小朋友的\\n小金船的Supisupi进行曲，Pisupiisu☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "bba2a9448f8e18806b582a260fb2138e3ef7cd3b7207ff2dc5f58b769f37494c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1127"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:437224849d5aedd5360f6189",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那天看到的星光，遥远而虚幻，\\n在这无法触及的地方消散——",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0f1d7911a81eda25af88eaec67353ae7c29419a889345d430660a69cdba81c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1128"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56b4a27a5890534aa5243ee4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "贯彻强烈意志的身姿，高贵而尊贵。\\n将苦难化为养分的钻石光辉，照亮未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "447fa53d7f4a100c29a78799ac4e1f805dde3276d521d63437c16dc6e65c44ed",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1129"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88f0d8ec0ddb536c4ba8fe52",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "种子和机关都由我亲手创造。\\n在摩天楼展现吧，像魔法一样的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a710135ccedd1a32f2c9af795a5d57f0625759f100448e15c094ee83ffe51b5b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1130"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d79fe848cb45f5e3dbe5383",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即使被疏远，也有持续照耀的光。\\n但是——现在超越了，将这憧憬的光献上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b23492e9aaa4358669ed6fe07341c04b6ca213feeb7f931229966900d10d34e3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57601a8ff4a1cc5f8bbedfeb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即使受伤，只要有憧憬的心情就能再次迈步。\\n无论何时，世界都可以改变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1d8f1755b21d10371bb517980a6db4e8d546ff3239a49c9dcabf9e23ab53a30",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1132"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c1a2fdc3107ac3605d7b3e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "来吧，开幕了！让你见识华丽的传说！\\n用尽言语赞美这个名字！世纪末霸王，好歌剧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5b3aaa8f90014440b2b6896775f06bf8698c75e11f1c197a5b33f700c6c4cae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1133"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbe797bdb1ed5789f921d897",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这双腿，这血液，让我奔跑。\\n我所展现的是最快的血统。我的奔跑是血潮的咆哮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bd182326a0fb3b86a043489ee40903c3bbb70393a333537e91c166eeebffade",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1134"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bf83ba8d72636a10c01699b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无论对手多强，无论挑战多么无谋，发动机都不会停。\\n只要灵魂点燃，就只管冲刺。奔向最棒的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d744e51fbae54f10e76bb28a193a396a645f606c7ded253efa79c723fccc7c3d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1135"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05433a9a914d56d19186e90c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "追逐的梦想，永远只有一个！\\n我一定要和你一起听！胜利的旋律！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa6916d4ba7af1d1ce0de05e58538ebb33001a2559dc8c86a96276d17a2d6af6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1136"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f50323b61064b721188c524",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "用力祈愿，虔诚祈祷！冲向闪耀的未来！\\n来吧来吧，请一起高唱！开运招福福来临！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4322df0f6749d9b6775b0deec0f9dc2408965b3fba58f1fd18cb4a15566b0a5a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1137"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e24f509f9ecadbe9bb160b77",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "来吧，出发！向着光明的未来。\\n——只要和你在一起，无论到哪里！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bba781826eb6751bc0d42d31262bc5750d454071e35fe0c38eaecac04956405",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1138"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6a63718ae295f1910039124",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "早上困倦，午餐美味，晚上疲惫。什么都没有。\\n不过，偶尔也可以期待一下吧。毕竟我也是赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4048a489b263e54c624ea91d9c60421fee9e506bb970aa78740ab54a31b4885c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1139"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab60ecde572fcb0c92bd0b4d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你能感受到吧，炽热的血潮。你能听到吧，灵魂的呐喊！\\n用正义之火讨伐邪恶！去吧，去吧去吧英雄！！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "567c9fa58ea9a714c1d544bf36866851df631f7b08b1c1518938dc6923323ed1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1140"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa032e8566a0f7b6111c9f0a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即使到达彼方并抓住，也会从手中滑落。所以——\\n追逐着，追逐着，追逐着——终于抓住了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7f320d5a750687b6c5f65b1062c121a4172ea9319190d805c3c2b4c932edc0e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0acb48477ef2d2a994fe0b7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "怀抱在心中的孤狼誓言绝不动摇。\\n无论是自己的影子还是前方的背影，都要像吞噬般甩开！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a50af3dfd4ac183324be6c3e376a783a196be0437b6123a3001d622374b83fbf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1142"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d487823478f05b97d104061",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "填补无数不足，稍微踮起脚尖。\\n我也一定能实现……因为我相信。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed351667d86f74118a1520bd0191f33fc0c4c0d1309a06f3abfd944c1d6c745e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1143"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ec57ffa6289c197675b1637",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "右手握着高贵，左手怀着慈爱。\\n为了成为引领一切的女王——走上吧，这荣耀之路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f357cd3cb44f6467f1cf906d3f7574665485ea3b7c928d2d02c21c74acf6431b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1144"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4eafdd04bcc40d31e690729",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "追逐憧憬，积累的努力一定会结出果实。\\n绚烂盛开的花束。如果要赠送的话，请一定送给你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dad49ff575fe1facafc391f5dd9bad2d232ae7738532c92d9fea448b0da34d38",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1145"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2f8eff1f522ce2c2c8003da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "心中燃烧的心之火焰，耀眼地燃烧着。\\n要与律动的节奏一起闪耀，my Queendom！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a9fa3c8bdfc8fc6a63ae75c271a7da5e367ba0bd922ef8e51f23b3e76a472e1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1146"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b67cbd5bf0c8af38b92c82aa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "用这双腿开拓无人到达的未来！\\n刻下只属于我的轨迹，追寻那天憧憬的荣冠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca16ec33cd4877eb4b4f00a87b4d7172b6567933e5952efb598fc94711c9c768",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1147"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a51584efa1ba47bed3b2f5c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "现在，宛如遥远银河的交响乐响彻。\\n为了夺回黑暗中的星光，像彗星一样奔跑吧“宇宙赛马娘”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80e1ba8491691ca9c22a9b7ae606c10942d2c580e49ef6953cc0b812b9c44a18",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1148"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:793a6e0cbb94992e21be3fa0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "去皮OK！火候刚好！营养满分！你猜隐藏的调味是什么？\\n美味做好啦！来，快来多吃点美食吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5c33de202c05eb96633a32558c1a22fa62aaa06263c8f7eed9ac2d89cd09768",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1149"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eeb2bf3876feca013460fbdd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "点缀四周年的 FORCE——那就是挑战之心！\\n从这里，属于你们时代的大门将开启！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1493701da3b2ea40656beb21d0a7b53ed22512b809f6c1111946c38c1ede9720",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1150"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aff58590375a5f5bcabd374a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "向在这个时代出生的所有人宣告——\\n来吧，放声欢呼吧。你也将成为『传奇』的暴风眼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02caca1d260628edd3a280446bef6a05390872387f615ae8f3c87ce7d8848be9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1151"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8b5ea5142ba89553407b5a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "海里的美味、河里的美味，全都来吧～☆人生就是要尽情享受\\n翻滚吧！带着鲑鱼般的好运，精彩地GO GO！",
      "source_fingerprint": "17cb8700fb13790b53d608e825b2e2744facdb84c869cf12f5a3e0fe48fa758e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1152"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee49875f7361a24cb11fcee8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你踏入的是自然丰富的特雷森岛！\\n这里只有大自然，这首曲子——还有肌肉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "829e1218cced757d57b4fb1e8634bb20b2af3a448a5a5d5877040857a79043cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1154"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4453572a1822497a08adb7d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "向着追寻已久的蹄印前方。\\n此刻，迈出步伐——将寄托的梦想负于肩上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34aa15630d44655ef8fc31148c729a0e8e38551632ec9b67f98b3f34b9efef61",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1155"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f71c3b5387e29c77cc5ebeb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "托大家的福——『已经变得这么大啦♡』\\n满载爱的感谢献给你♡请从你喜欢的地方欣赏吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9389e9191ca86fe128e63a10d6e29a0c52b3432dcb5213a9e9b710e0fb8e0ab2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1156"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7587cfed32520cc283a11d62",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那日的记忆在蒸汽般飘荡，令人难忘，但又模糊不清……\\n请听「汤驹浪漫纯情派」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "446387d745bfbc15d2f1ac23bfa9ce9f3fc48fbfa0afa6e02568744f72736c7b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1157"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1253faff0e7e470310794531",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "踢飞无聊的夜晚，这是『BoC'z we＼n』的最新单曲。\\n铭刻下、交错融合的 AM×i／OK→U／CΛ2 的 flow 吧——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "869ced8d6ed0b1e8eb4ca06435493e58cd94b9eb34244120058350f5e9a9d6c4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1158"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b6d07328fa9c06ac1e2b2bd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "常识被一脚踢开，灰烬在大地上刻下痕迹。\\n坠入吧，向着黑白的世界——",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd63e8cb348f417b0790aa1d7a0f29f22cd9e48dc77937f1f48dd177dbce2bf2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1159"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a2708518f7030d3b08f221d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喧哗上等！放马过来！有这首歌的话绝对不会输！\\n把你们全部都弄得头冒金星！……这就是充满如此气概的灵魂之曲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "126e6e92def6be6adb0f4a1f40f084f4d135c95f25e616c0357ed4333ec61ad8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1160"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a69ca3c67cd5df11f121121",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正在寻找未知的“某物”——为了触动心灵深处。\\n那么，今天要度过怎样的一天呢？一边听这首歌一边思考吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5a8700d4892614cc7c8bded3bef4e414d92959597513a7e90fb0c5a36a2458d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4e07d4aebcbf0bf95c9f45b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那段时光里不变的热血梦想，凝聚成这一曲。定能传递给每一个人！\\n脚下的大地虽不同，但仰望的星空却是同一片！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9845ef97d776adf87dd40f76e9b6ee1188fb6035462e0dea20b3613624b058db",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1162"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fc4904b85075c945c5aaf61",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "刻骨铭心，一生都无法消逝的景色————\\n“爱”往往就是如此之物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fcbfc73cec9fa3f54b824d22c4bfc97f30b07cc6154e5640fda22f8a9b4633d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1163"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d118827b55e4807780023b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为了清白正直，让我们忍耐吧。严于律己，\\n唯有自制。忍耐才是美德。是的，听了这首歌就会明白。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ba58c507e871bc5d510a390c22bb40dd27fba3c7d13ebf5726b6c51d98a17f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1164"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d517c4e1a11a67b09264a8f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "万物所向披靡的优雅旋律，是胜者的绝对证明！\\n 她的道路无人能挡！只因任何事物在她面前都如微风一般！",
      "source_fingerprint": "279e8266208df5b9898cca31a8a03d4d3108fd7ed403a5256d277e854cdadef9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1165"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db6aa96856d625004baabacf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "随心所欲，随风而去，飞向遥远的彼方！\\n若想知晓风的去向，聆听这首曲子便好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1e4f9f90703a4fbce1ac659e498a22e099726259e03fc7805fe3ca2d3814977",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1166"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:878a58b2c9d9a7184d2fca7c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "太阳正在地平线的某处升起……只是并非此处。\\n奔跑吧。总有一天，这片阴云也会散去的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d99301dff80f85a39826c71a529a90d86f47d6e8ca7afd247c00feaf4eb988d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1167"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6bc73d7042725b4d5cb2cdc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跪拜聆听！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01a45ddd47190dd605ff10534746b38f4445acf5dbe1eb7223fc4b2bb8e52034",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1168"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8aeacd594255264ae4c4127d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "旅途中拾起的风景，将成为连接未来的梦想。\\n那么，今晚又会做怎样的梦呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d166a88f224e103b6db8cf966a06f3894f8450c2244ce374dbc53558cb653c08",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1169"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:631e62c8a7473069e194a24f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有一种光芒让人无法移开目光。\\n只要听这首曲子——不，其实你已经知道了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "84c1069438893b8b342f49be79a0fbcd74beaebfae1db7b7b55fe46b95dc74dd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1170"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f7c18bc56606e1deecc2165",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "辉煌梦想的顶峰遥不可及，前路充满绝望……\\n然后，少女走向了荣华之门。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c63fb5e5fc8c077ffd924bd72837f270315103a34fbdc432f65fff6d1d6b6e6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1171"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d377f13b8f6d61a5da77bd7a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "争先恐后超越他人的背影！\\n燃烧的热情终将成为照亮新时代的灯火！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddcf1d5230d4828111729dca81c545cb8c92f21c7ecee16cf5822fbb41b8588a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1172"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3a6a5d3c19639d9bd123d27",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "奔跑吧，Frontier！用震撼的全力疾奔撼动世界！\\n来吧，究竟是谁将开辟全新的世界！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "31bfa0f750cc4c0261397fc7f8043ca9d504fe02b566b0ae120dd066c3e278fa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1173"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45bccc91862cf3a2f91a404b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在夕阳余晖下的归途，某天突然溢出的旋律。\\n\n不可思议地，声音重叠着传来……就像那一天一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a0cb889eb3f274423dc57723cb5906a514a3a3348772f60170bb5edcb447303",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1174"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31be97cde28fff86030e9b16",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一起奔跑的日子。不知不觉已经来到了这么远的地方。\\n并肩奔跑的两人的牵绊，将一直延续到梦想的尽头——",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb31f9039a1867f66a6b02cd63cde340fd54566f07d4833d860f5ebba37cfd7a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1175"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78c5fe72d01388b878619089",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "划破风暴的，是你那举世无双的光芒——\\n披挂上阵吧，在那缤纷绚烂的色彩中。鸣响吧，那革命的歌声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c9e57f10d99f84b70df7259ea1d79ff1cc8fdc1480777f125476c217d6d949b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1176"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d2071440960643b1aa7f2ab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在这场豪华绚丽的盛典中，证明出团队的羁绊。\n以此团结之力攀登世界之巅！拿下吧，美国梦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3049ae23595807548430a941542d8affaebc1af8f855bee2fedebe145e7713d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1177"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78225a9b059a49631af7cee8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想要比任何人都要强烈、激烈，闪耀如流星般的一曲！\\n掠过天际的灰色轨迹，将会震撼每一个人的心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ea5a311120350b01b2e5e126f197395e02124bdc9ef578334c4ce980a2aadb1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1178"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d37c2e6a3046d139960ab588",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不善于使用言语表达……即便如此，还是想要传达出来。\\n就是这样，一首稍微有点笨拙的歌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9200df9f4e31ab61ab761352bfa7b58f487e5898d0073bb2df8f169045744fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1179"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:181cc577cf445e3c42dfc61d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赠予你的这一碗。面条、配菜与热情，\\n盛满平日里满满的感谢——嘿，让您久等啦！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "505c5b425c9c1f6aea176c1aceec6b0ec5737c508b5a4a4ffed834da334ebdb9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:996c7568e8341c51f3593486",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『#kawaii』『#梦幻柔软』『#心动不已？』\\n可爱是能传达到宇宙的暗号！呐，可以再多喜欢我一点吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "410a1d5da43efff3a849005af5e013bf077ba6e7dbd5d0d32f6041d35c4f9657",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1182"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c9f68bc65e67e485df90050",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "高涨的心跳已经无法抑制！ \\n毫无保留地倾诉炽热的思念，一首让人心跳加速的歌曲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a525512dfe02bc7cae1075026fa2cd5d2986b8e82552815abe5ae72293e3aae0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1183"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79dfc863223b14a2e4f300f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "灵魂为之震颤，歌颂着骄傲不屈的乐曲。\\n绝不会轻易屈服，直到成为“女王”的那一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e1eb37482eefe949d29706f459830f31bbd17a64c4ad188500011b431a96e3b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1184"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:524e9bf9062d0bcfb924af3a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拜托了♡正因为是你，我才会这么想撒娇。\\n连全世界都会为之着迷的，可爱的流行歌曲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "525912bcfb92b78bbe7a757d8f429cf8d1ba8bc7bda5a94d92455959be5e95c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1185"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d65627bcaaf9193b139f920",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "注入了能一扫无聊日常的特别魔法的乐曲！\\n只需要相信的心。仅凭这一点——无论什么都一定能做到！",
